{"text":"kuruntokai","n":301,"lines":["முழவுமுத லரைய தடவுநிலைப் பெண்ணைக்","கொழுமட லிழைத்த சிறுகோற் குடம்பைக்","கருங்கா லன்றிற் காமர் கடுஞ்சூல்","வயவுப்பெடை யகவும் பானாட் கங்குல்","மன்றம் போழும் இனமணி நெடுந்தேர்","வாரா தாயினும் வருவது போலச்","செவிமுத லிசைக்கு மரவமொடு","துயில்துறந் தனவால் தோழியென் கண்ணே"],"tr":["muḻavumuta laraiya taṭavunilaip peṇṇaik","koḻumaṭa liḻaitta ciṟukōṟ kuṭampaik","karuṅkā laṉṟiṟ kāmar kaṭuñcūl","vayavuppeṭai yakavum pāṉāṭ kaṅkul","maṉṟam pōḻum iṉamaṇi neṭuntēr","vārā tāyiṉum varuvatu pōlac","cevimuta licaikku maravamoṭu","tuyiltuṟan taṉavāl tōḻiyeṉ kaṇṇē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"குன்றியனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kuṉṟiyaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"8 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"7×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 27, veṇcīr 3, vañcicīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 14, veṇṭaḷai 13, kalittaḷai 2, oṉṟiya vañcittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"முழவுமுத","tr":"muḻavumuta","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முழ","tr":"muḻa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுமு","tr":"vumu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"லரைய","tr":"laraiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"லரை","tr":"larai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"தடவுநிலைப்","tr":"taṭavunilaip","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தட","tr":"taṭa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுநி","tr":"vuni"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லைப்","tr":"laip"}]},{"text":"பெண்ணைக்","tr":"peṇṇaik","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பெண்","tr":"peṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணைக்","tr":"ṇaik"}]}],[{"text":"கொழுமட","tr":"koḻumaṭa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொழு","tr":"koḻu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மட","tr":"maṭa"}]},{"text":"லிழைத்த","tr":"liḻaitta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"லிழைத்","tr":"liḻait"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"சிறுகோற்","tr":"ciṟukōṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோற்","tr":"kōṟ"}]},{"text":"குடம்பைக்","tr":"kuṭampaik","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குடம்","tr":"kuṭam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பைக்","tr":"paik"}]}],[{"text":"கருங்கா","tr":"karuṅkā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கருங்","tr":"karuṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"}]},{"text":"லன்றிற்","tr":"laṉṟiṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லன்","tr":"laṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றிற்","tr":"ṟiṟ"}]},{"text":"காமர்","tr":"kāmar","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மர்","tr":"mar"}]},{"text":"கடுஞ்சூல்","tr":"kaṭuñcūl","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடுஞ்","tr":"kaṭuñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சூல்","tr":"cūl"}]}],[{"text":"வயவுப்பெடை","tr":"vayavuppeṭai","foot":"puḷimāṅkaṉi","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வய","tr":"vaya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வுப்","tr":"vup"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெடை","tr":"peṭai"}]},{"text":"யகவும்","tr":"yakavum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யக","tr":"yaka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வும்","tr":"vum"}]},{"text":"பானாட்","tr":"pāṉāṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாட்","tr":"ṉāṭ"}]},{"text":"கங்குல்","tr":"kaṅkul","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கங்","tr":"kaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குல்","tr":"kul"}]}],[{"text":"மன்றம்","tr":"maṉṟam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றம்","tr":"ṟam"}]},{"text":"போழும்","tr":"pōḻum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழும்","tr":"ḻum"}]},{"text":"இனமணி","tr":"iṉamaṇi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இன","tr":"iṉa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணி","tr":"maṇi"}]},{"text":"நெடுந்தேர்","tr":"neṭuntēr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடுந்","tr":"neṭun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தேர்","tr":"tēr"}]}],[{"text":"வாரா","tr":"vārā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரா","tr":"rā"}]},{"text":"தாயினும்","tr":"tāyiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினும்","tr":"yiṉum"}]},{"text":"வருவது","tr":"varuvatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரு","tr":"varu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வது","tr":"vatu"}]},{"text":"போலச்","tr":"pōlac","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லச்","tr":"lac"}]}],[{"text":"செவிமுத","tr":"cevimuta","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செவி","tr":"cevi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முத","tr":"muta"}]},{"text":"லிசைக்கு","tr":"licaikku","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"லிசைக்","tr":"licaik"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]},{"text":"மரவமொடு","tr":"maravamoṭu","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மர","tr":"mara"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வமொ","tr":"vamo"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]}],[{"text":"துயில்துறந்","tr":"tuyiltuṟan","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துயில்","tr":"tuyil"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறந்","tr":"tuṟan"}]},{"text":"தனவால்","tr":"taṉavāl","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வால்","tr":"vāl"}]},{"text":"தோழியென்","tr":"tōḻiyeṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியென்","tr":"ḻiyeṉ"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"முழவுமுதல்","parts":[{"text":"முழவு","lemma":"muḻavu","gloss":"drum"},{"text":"முதல்","lemma":"mutal","gloss":"base"}],"gloss":"drum-like base"},{"surface":"அரைய","parts":[{"text":"அரை","lemma":"arai","gloss":"trunk"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"having a trunk"},{"surface":"தடவுநிலை","parts":[{"text":"தடவு","lemma":"taṭavu","gloss":"large/curved"},{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"nilai","gloss":"stature/standing"}],"gloss":"large-statured"},{"surface":"பெண்ணை","parts":[{"text":"பெண்ணை","lemma":"peṇṇai","gloss":"palmyra palm"}],"gloss":"palmyra palm tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொழுமடல்","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"koḻu","gloss":"thick/fertile"},{"text":"மடல்","lemma":"maṭal","gloss":"frond"}],"gloss":"thick palmyra fronds"},{"surface":"இழைத்த","parts":[{"text":"இழை","lemma":"iḻai","gloss":"weave/fashion"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"tta","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"woven"},{"surface":"சிறுகோல்","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"ciṟu","gloss":"small"},{"text":"கோல்","lemma":"kōl","gloss":"twig/stick"}],"gloss":"small twigs"},{"surface":"குடம்பை","parts":[{"text":"குடம்பை","lemma":"kuṭampai","gloss":"nest"}],"gloss":"nest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கருங்கால்","parts":[{"text":"கருமை","lemma":"karumai","gloss":"black"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"kāl","gloss":"leg"}],"gloss":"black-legged"},{"surface":"அன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"அன்றில்","lemma":"anṟil","gloss":"anril bird"}],"gloss":"anril bird"},{"surface":"காமர்","parts":[{"text":"காமர்","lemma":"kāmar","gloss":"desirable/loving"}],"gloss":"desirable/loving"},{"surface":"கடுஞ்சூல்","parts":[{"text":"கடும்","lemma":"kaṭu","gloss":"intense/advanced"},{"text":"சூல்","lemma":"cūl","gloss":"pregnancy"}],"gloss":"advanced pregnancy"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வயவுப்பெடை","parts":[{"text":"வயவு","lemma":"vayavu","gloss":"pregnancy longing"},{"text":"பெடை","lemma":"peṭai","gloss":"female bird"}],"gloss":"pregnant female bird"},{"surface":"அகவும்","parts":[{"text":"அகவு","lemma":"akavu","gloss":"call/cry out"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"calling out"},{"surface":"பானாள்","parts":[{"text":"பானாள்","lemma":"பானாள்","gloss":"midnight"}],"gloss":"midnight","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கங்குல்","parts":[{"text":"கங்குல்","lemma":"kaṅkul","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"night"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மன்றம்","parts":[{"text":"மன்றம்","lemma":"maṉṟam","gloss":"village common ground"}],"gloss":"village common ground"},{"surface":"போழும்","parts":[{"text":"போழ்","lemma":"pōḻ","gloss":"cleave/cut through"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"cleaving"},{"surface":"இனமணி","parts":[{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"iṉam","gloss":"group/sweet-sounding"},{"text":"மணி","lemma":"maṇi","gloss":"bell"}],"gloss":"group of bells"},{"surface":"நெடுந்தேர்","parts":[{"text":"நெடுமை","lemma":"neṭumai","gloss":"tall/long"},{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"tēr","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"tall chariot"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாராது","parts":[{"text":"வாரா","lemma":"vārā","gloss":"not coming"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"pronominal suffix"}],"gloss":"not coming"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"āyiṉum","gloss":"even though"}],"gloss":"even though"},{"surface":"வருவது","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"come"},{"text":"வது","lemma":"vatu","gloss":"nominalizing suffix"}],"gloss":"coming"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like/as if"}],"gloss":"as if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செவிமுதல்","parts":[{"text":"செவி","lemma":"cevi","gloss":"ear"},{"text":"முதல்","lemma":"mutal","gloss":"entrance/base"}],"gloss":"entrance of the ear"},{"surface":"இசைக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"இசை","lemma":"icai","gloss":"sound"},{"text":"க்கும்","lemma":"kkum","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"ringing/sounding"},{"surface":"அரவமொடு","parts":[{"text":"அரவம்","lemma":"aravam","gloss":"sound/noise"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the sound"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துயில்","parts":[{"text":"துயில்","lemma":"tuyil","gloss":"sleep"}],"gloss":"sleep"},{"surface":"துறந்தன","parts":[{"text":"துற","lemma":"tuṟa","gloss":"abandon/give up"},{"text":"ந்தன","lemma":"ntaṉa","gloss":"past third person neuter plural suffix"}],"gloss":"they abandoned"},{"surface":"ஆல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"āl","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"கண்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"eyes"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"Palmyra palm tree of large stature with a trunk like a drum base, / in its nest of small twigs woven with thick palmyra fronds, / the black-legged anril bird's desirable, advanced pregnant / female bird with pregnancy cravings calls out at midnight, / cleaving through the village common ground, the tall chariot with a group of bells / even though it does not come, as if it is coming, / with the sound ringing inside my ears, / my eyes have indeed abandoned sleep, O friend!","translation":"On the palmyra palm tree, which stands tall with a trunk as thick as a drum's base, inside a nest of small twigs woven with thick fronds, the black-legged female anril bird, heavy with advanced pregnancy and filled with longing, calls out at midnight. At this hour, even though his tall chariot with its cluster of bells does not come cleaving through the village common ground, my ears ring with that very sound as if he is arriving. Because of this, O friend, my eyes have completely abandoned sleep.","modern":"முழவின் அடிப்பகுதி போன்ற தடித்த தண்டுடைய, பெரிய பனைமரத்தின் செழுமையான மடல்களாலும் சிறு குச்சிகளாலும் கட்டப்பட்ட கூட்டில், கரிய கால்களையுடைய அன்றில் பறவையின் ஆசையூட்டும் முதிர்ந்த சூலினைக் கொண்ட பெண் பறவை தன் கர்ப்ப வேட்கையால் நள்ளிரவில் கூவுகிறது. அந்த நள்ளிரவில், ஊர் மன்றத்தைக் கடந்து வரும் ஒலிக்கின்ற மணிகளைக் கொண்ட தலைவனின் நெடிய தேர் வராவிட்டாலும், அது வருவது போல என் காதுகளில் அந்த ஓசை ஒலிக்கிறது. அதனால், தோழியே! என் கண்கள் தூக்கத்தை முழுமையாகத் துறந்துவிட்டன.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend in a state of deep distress during the midnight hours. She describes a pregnant female anril bird crying out from its nest in a tall palmyra tree, an image that intensifies her own feelings of loneliness and longing. Although the hero's bell-adorned chariot has not actually arrived, she constantly imagines hearing its sound passing through the village common ground. This auditory illusion keeps her awake, causing her eyes to completely abandon sleep. The imagery of the nesting anril bird, traditionally known for its inseparable partnership, serves as a poignant contrast to the heroine's solitary waiting.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}